<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλαιστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expert in wrestling</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1361b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				20.14
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>the art of wrestling</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.39.3
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.149
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>suited for wrestling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.130b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρνα -ώτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιστρικός</span>.</div>
